--[[
	Unboxing Reference Collector  v1.0
	Read-only, client-side inspection tool (Luau, written for the Delta executor).

	WHAT IT DOES
	  * Walks the parts of the DataModel the client can legitimately see and records what it observes.
	  * Watches the session with events (DescendantAdded/Removing, AttributeChanged, Changed, Text changes).
	  * Exports everything as JSON (file via writefile when available, console fallback otherwise).

	WHAT IT NEVER DOES
	  * Never writes to any game Instance (no property sets, no :Destroy, no :Clone, no reparenting).
	  * Never fires/invokes RemoteEvents or RemoteFunctions (they are only listed by name/class).
	  * Never reads script source, never uses getgc/getsenv/hookfunction/hookmetamethod/getrawmetatable.
	  * Never uses HttpGet/request/loadstring or sends data anywhere. (One optional Roblox API call:
	    MarketplaceService:GetProductInfo, used only to check the place name. Disable: CONFIG.FETCH_PLACE_NAME.)
	  * Other players' characters and per-player folders are skipped on purpose.

	Everything unknown is exported as "not_observed" (or null). Nothing is guessed.
]]

